From 4b7c91199b00d18266cafd0e67e021155a818201 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tobias <ruck.tobias@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 22 Nov 2024 19:01:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [DogeCash] Rename bitcoin.conf to dogecoin.conf (#75)

Parallels the `bitcoind` -> `dogecoind` change

Current-ABC adaptation (2026-10-14): Carry dogecoin.conf into current ArgsManager and all functional-test config consumers, preserving internal configuration interfaces.

Original-Commit: e4ab9170e038afdf7396dfb43d092ae971db6e19

